' Observed behavior: the current request path has no node-local admission gate and contains unbounded event buffers.
' Design reason: show where concurrency multiplies and where memory, CPU, and downstream pressure can accumulate.
@startuml observed_concurrency_hot_path
title Observed CampusClaw Concurrency Hot Path

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #374151

actor "WebSocket Client" as client

rectangle "Reactor Netty Request Path" as netty {
  component "ChatWebSocketHandler.handle" as ws
  component "Unbounded outbound sink\nplus 50 ms busy-loop emit" as outbound #FFDDDD
}

rectangle "Session Construction" as session_area {
  component "SessionPool.getOrCreate\nget - create - put" as pool #FFDDDD
  component "AgentSession.initialize\nmodel, tools, skills, files, prompt" as init #FFE9CC
}

rectangle "Agent Run" as run_area {
  component "New agent virtual thread" as agent_vt
  component "AgentLoop\nblocking stream consumption" as loop
  component "Parallel tool virtual threads\nno global tool gate" as tools #FFE9CC
}

rectangle "Provider Stream" as provider_area {
  component "New provider virtual thread" as provider_vt
  component "New OpenAIClient per run" as client_per_run #FFE9CC
  component "Unbounded EventStream" as event_stream #FFDDDD
  component "Cumulative partial message\nrebuilt and serialized per delta" as cumulative #FFDDDD
}

database "Local JSONL\nflush on every append" as jsonl #FFE9CC

client --> ws : connect and prompt
ws --> pool : synchronous getOrCreate
pool --> init : synchronous initialization
init --> agent_vt : session.prompt
agent_vt --> loop : execute one run
loop --> provider_vt : streamSimple
provider_vt --> client_per_run : build and close
client_per_run --> event_stream : blocking response stream
event_stream --> cumulative : every provider event
cumulative --> outbound : full message_update JSON
outbound --> client : WebSocket send
loop --> tools : optional fan-out
ws --> jsonl : terminal message append

note right of pool
  No resident-session cap.
  Concurrent misses can build
  duplicate session candidates.
end note

note right of event_stream
  Slow production or consumption
  has no byte or item budget.
end note

note bottom of outbound
  A slow connection can retain
  an unbounded number of frames.
end note
@enduml

